## 1. Create `employee` table and insert data

```sql
CREATE DATABASE company;
USE company;

CREATE TABLE employee (
    emp_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    emp_name VARCHAR(50),
    age INT,
    gender CHAR(1),
    salary DECIMAL(10,2),
    department VARCHAR(50)
);
```

